  "notice": "# --------------------------------------------------------------------\n#\n#  Quran Translation\n#  Name: Transliteration\n#  Translator: English Transliteration\n#  Language: English\n#  ID: en.transliteration\n#  Last Update: September 6, 2010\n#  Source: Tanzil.net\n#\n# --------------------------------------------------------------------\n",
